# MAX — SRS Gap Fix: Implementation Plan

Fix all Phase-1 MVP gaps identified in the SRS review, working from highest to lowest priority.
No existing automated tests were found — verification will use manual CLI testing.

---

## Fix 1 — Prime Mode Auth Bug (FR-05) 🔴 CRITICAL

**Problem:** [_handle_auth_prime()](file:///c:/Users/nithi/Desktop/MAX/max/max_core/core/orchestrator.py#197-201) activates Prime Mode without verifying passphrase.

#### [MODIFY] [orchestrator.py](file:///c:/Users/nithi/Desktop/MAX/max/max_core/core/orchestrator.py)
- In [_handle_auth_prime()](file:///c:/Users/nithi/Desktop/MAX/max/max_core/core/orchestrator.py#197-201): call `self.pass_manager.verify(phrase)` before calling [activate_prime()](file:///c:/Users/nithi/Desktop/MAX/max/max_core/modes/mode_manager.py#5-7)
- If verification fails, print error and stay in User Mode
- If no passphrase is set, require setting one first

---

## Fix 2 — Timer Actions: Shutdown/Lock After Delay (FR-14)

**Problem:** Scheduler only prints a notification. Delayed `shutdown`, `lock`, `restart` commands don't exist.

#### [MODIFY] [scheduler.py](file:///c:/Users/nithi/Desktop/MAX/max/max_core/automation/scheduler.py)
- Add `schedule_action(delay_seconds, action_type, message)` method
- Supported `action_type`: `"NOTIFY"`, `"SHUTDOWN"`, `"LOCK"`, `"RESTART"`
- Execute OS actions via `subprocess` or `ctypes` after delay

#### [MODIFY] [command_parser.py](file:///c:/Users/nithi/Desktop/MAX/max/max_core/interpreter/command_parser.py)
- Add parsing for: `"shut down after 20 minutes"`, `"lock after 10 minutes"`, `"restart after 5 minutes"`
- New intent: `SCHEDULE_ACTION` with entities `{action, delay_seconds}`

#### [MODIFY] [orchestrator.py](file:///c:/Users/nithi/Desktop/MAX/max/max_core/core/orchestrator.py)
- Handle `SCHEDULE_ACTION` intent → call `scheduler.schedule_action()`

---

## Fix 3 — Semantic / Date-Based File Open (FR-07)

**Problem:** "Open yesterday's PPT" fails — no time-aware or semantic file search.

#### [MODIFY] [command_executor.py](file:///c:/Users/nithi/Desktop/MAX/max/max_core/executor/command_executor.py)
- New method `_semantic_file_search(target)`:
  - Parse date keywords: `yesterday`, `last week`, `today`, `latest`, `recent`, `newest`
  - Parse type keywords: `PPT/presentation`, `PDF`, `resume`, `doc/document`, `image/photo`, [video](file:///c:/Users/nithi/Desktop/MAX/max/max_core/executor/command_executor.py#645-669)
  - Search Desktop, Documents, Downloads filtered by `mtime` and extension
  - Return best match

#### [MODIFY] [command_parser.py](file:///c:/Users/nithi/Desktop/MAX/max/max_core/interpreter/command_parser.py)
- Enhance `OPEN_APP_OR_FOLDER` entity extraction to detect `date_hint` and `type_hint`

