## Verification Plan

### Manual CLI Testing (run: `cd max && python main.py`)

| Fix | Test Command | Expected |
|---|---|---|
| Fix 1 | `enter prime wrongpassword` | "Incorrect passphrase" |
| Fix 1 | `enter prime correctpassword` | "PRIME mode activated" |
| Fix 2 | `shut down after 2 minutes` | "Okay, shutting down in 2 minutes" |
| Fix 2 | `lock after 10 seconds` | Lock screen after 10 sec |
| Fix 3 | `open yesterday's presentation` | Opens most recent .pptx from yesterday |
| Fix 3 | `open my latest resume` | Opens newest .pdf/docx matching "resume" |
| Fix 4 | `lock the screen` | Windows lock screen triggers |
| Fix 6 | `what's running on Desktop 2` | Lists apps on virtual desktop 2 |
| Fix 6 | `pause YouTube on Desktop 3` | YouTube pauses without screen switch |
| Fix 7 | `notify me when download finishes` | Notification fires after download done |
| Fix 8 | `open chrome and then open notepad` | Both open sequentially |
| Fix 9 | `delete test.txt` | Asks "Are you sure? (yes/no)" |

### Voice Testing (run: `cd max && python voice_main.py`)
- Say each above command out loud — verify STT picks it up and result is correct.
- After Fix 5: say "enroll my voice" → record enrollment → try command from different person → should be rejected.
